msgid "TiltFive"
msgstr "TiltFive"

msgid ""
"TiltFive is a PC based, multiplayer AR device specializing in table top "
"gaming. Support for this platform is offered through the `TiltFive Godot "
"plugin. <https://github.com/GodotVR/TiltFiveGodot4>`__"
msgstr ""
"TiltFive 是一款基于 PC 的多人 AR 设备，专为桌面游戏设计。该平台的支持通过 "
"`TiltFive Godot plugin. <https://github.com/GodotVR/TiltFiveGodot4>`__ 提供"

msgid ""
"For more information, please consult the documentation provided with the "
"plugin."
msgstr "如需了解更多信息，请参阅随插件提供的文档。"

msgid ""
"This plugin is **not** maintained by the Godot Foundation. A few intrepid "
"contributors ensure development of the plugin as needed."
msgstr ""
"本插件 **并非** 由 Godot 基金会维护。少数勇敢的贡献者会根据实际需求负责该插件"
"的开发工作。"
